<title>MOROCCO: Malta Treasury to issue bills worth $42.9 million.</title>
<headline>Malta Treasury to issue bills worth $42.9 million.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malta's Treasury will issue 1.33 million Maltese pounds ($3.38 million) in 28-day bills on Friday maturing on May 2, 1997 at an average yield rate per annum of 5.0211 percent, a Treasury official said.</p>
<p>It will also issue bills worth 15.26 million pounds ($39.6 million) in 91-day bills at 5.0299 percent per year.</p>
<p>The yield rates are unchanged in the 28-day and 91-day bills.</p>
</text>
